    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Welcome to the Guru Guru Community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Guru Guru Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in activities and discussions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide feedback on the gameplay and let's make this game even more enjoyable together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/64226d5977aa0a41809a8e4fb42b6bfa.avif?t=1752213293\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aGuru Guru\u300b is a party brawler game supporting online multiplayer for up to 8 players. You can experience various maps in the game, and achieve the ultimate goal through confrontation or collaboration with friends \u2013 winning the match by any means necessary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the world of \u300aGuru Guru\u300b, you'll transform into a round critter and collide with your enemies (or teammates?) to the fullest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything in \u300aGuru Guru\u300b is highly &quot;realistic&quot;. According to the Guru Guru Law, when a Guru Guru becomes too round, it's extremely difficult to stop...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Skills, No Burden for Guru Guru</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Guru world, every Guru Guru is a master of skills, possessing a vast array of abilities. With these skills, Guru Gurus will be unstoppable (maybe?), invincible (possibly?). Oh, and since Guru Gurus have poor memory, every battle brings new surprises. Additionally, most skills affect both friends and foes...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Guru Guru is as full of uncertainty as the Guru Gurus themselves. One match is sunny and calm, while the next is stormy with thunder and lightning. Remember what a great Guru Guru in history once said: &quot;Accurate weather forecasts lead to stable Guru Guru victories.&quot; Should that be right? After all, it was a great Guru Guru!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasures Abound, Guru Guru</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During Guru Guru's struggles, &quot;rare treasures&quot; occasionally appear. Clever Guru Gurus often pick up these items and then achieve... (This Guru was sent to the hospital due to item quality issues). Ahem, anyway, the Guru Guru Guide states: &quot;You can pick up and throw anything, including other Guru Gurus.&quot; Wonder if that's true?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ever-Changing Guru Realm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Guru Guru not only has diverse scenes but also changes constantly. Guru Gurus can have fun (or fight each other) in different arenas. However, according to a Guru Guru, the place they played yesterday was completely different when they returned today. Could it be the Eighth of the Seven Wonders?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Gurus Love Fashion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, there are not only various types of Guru Gurus but also extensive wardrobes for each. Quickly put on your favorite outfit and go beat up other Guru Gurus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hurry up and call your friends to transform into Guru Gurus together and embark on a wonderful journey in the world of Guru Guru!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aGuru Guru\u300b is a party brawler game supporting online multiplayer for up to 8 players. You can experience various maps in the game, and achieve the ultimate goal through confrontation or collaboration with friends \u2013 winning the match by any means necessary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the world of \u300aGuru Guru\u300b, you'll transform into a round critter and collide with your enemies (or teammates?) to the fullest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything in \u300aGuru Guru\u300b is highly &quot;realistic&quot;. According to the Guru Guru Law, when a Guru Guru becomes too round, it's extremely difficult to stop...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Skills, No Burden for Guru Guru</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/da21ec7b0187385a42ae8d0fcdb22218.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Guru world, every Guru Guru is a master of skills, possessing a vast array of abilities. With these skills, Guru Gurus will be unstoppable (maybe?), invincible (possibly?). Oh, and since Guru Gurus have poor memory, every battle brings new surprises. Additionally, most skills affect both friends and foes...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/83be1085e9e48e0fb423d16ef731273d.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Guru Guru is as full of uncertainty as the Guru Gurus themselves. One match is sunny and calm, while the next is stormy with thunder and lightning. Remember what a great Guru Guru in history once said: &quot;Accurate weather forecasts lead to stable Guru Guru victories.&quot; Should that be right? After all, it was a great Guru Guru!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasures Abound, Guru Guru</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/afbf38a21ef59e50569e2ba198b1d1e6.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During Guru Guru's struggles, &quot;rare treasures&quot; occasionally appear. Clever Guru Gurus often pick up these items and then achieve... (This Guru was sent to the hospital due to item quality issues). Ahem, anyway, the Guru Guru Guide states: &quot;You can pick up and throw anything, including other Guru Gurus.&quot; Wonder if that's true?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ever-Changing Guru Realm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/b99a3a16897c8a362d196c95aecb7171.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Guru Guru not only has diverse scenes but also changes constantly. Guru Gurus can have fun (or fight each other) in different arenas. However, according to a Guru Guru, the place they played yesterday was completely different when they returned today. Could it be the Eighth of the Seven Wonders?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Gurus Love Fashion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.poster.avif?t=1752213293\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.webm?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934340/extras/a4438ad7e67daf953dd481cf0803c48f.mp4?t=1752213293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, there are not only various types of Guru Gurus but also extensive wardrobes for each. Quickly put on your favorite outfit and go beat up other Guru Gurus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hurry up and call your friends to transform into Guru Gurus together and embark on a wonderful journey in the world of Guru Guru!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aGuru Guru\u300b is a fun 8-player online party game with physics! You play as a round Guru Guru critter. On different maps, use skills, items, and anything you can to knock out enemies (or even teammates!) and win however you can\u2014no rules, just chaos and fun with friends!",
